M3.9 release-gate ignored-artifact diagnosis
Date: 2026-08-27
Result: gate blocked; S1 service remained disabled and inactive

The root-run release-manifest generator imported its adjacent Control helper
and created only `scripts/__pycache__/` inside the not-yet-active Control
release. The immutable release gate correctly rejected that ignored artifact.

The remediation removes only the path reported by `git clean -ndx`, verifies
the repository is clean again and runs all subsequent Control Python tools
with `PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1`. The committed Control tree, manifest content,
database, configuration and application release are not modified.
